(text "OPEN BEFORE FABRICATION" (at 30 170 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid 613a8836-1f6c-4e80-a299-c182aa1905e8))
(text "1. Conductor excitation/truth table and FIE thresholds; no patent-avoidance claim is established.\n2. External fault, ESD and power-off injection protection; common-ground USB is NOT galvanically isolated.\n3. Power-stage stability, capacitor derating, oscillator load and USB startup/suspend power budget.\n4. Complete placement, ground strategy, power routing, DRC, model alignment and bench acceptance.\n5. Exact HUB75 panel current and connector fit; FA-05 loop current/CTR, cable and polarity verification." (at 30 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid 10bca366-b7d3-4bcc-a6f3-37558cf55f2a))
(text "Power source declarations and design status" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid c0dd0398-cf9e-4e93-a101-0029074094e8))
(text "Power flags describe external/module-fed nets for ERC only. They are not protection devices, proof of safety, or permission to fabricate." (at 20 22 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid 81590e79-9d89-4764-ae36-70f6c0c075e4)) (embedded_fonts no))